WEBVTT

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:35.440
<b>Episode 6:     The Maid I Hired Recently Is Weird!?</b>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.910
<b>Napa Cabbage</b>

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.900
<i>This napa cabbage looks great, 
and it's affordable.</i>

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.040
<i>I think I'll make creamed chicken 
with napa cabbage tonight.</i>

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.750
I'm going to eat my carrots today!

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.100
Really?

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.110
Dad promised he'll give me 
a piggyback ride if I do.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:52.840
Oh, really?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.370
Good for you.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.730
Lilith is my precious family.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.630
It's raining.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:17.970
Oh, yeah. Lilith is out shopping, isn't she?

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:19.790
I'm home.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.720
I got caught in a sudden evening shower.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:27.180
I'm all wet.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:28.890
A towel, right?

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.210
I'll go get a towel.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:34.010
Thank you.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.270
You should take a bath.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.270
You'll catch a cold.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.630
Would you like to take a bath with me?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:46.630
We can't do that until we're married!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.300
Sheesh, you're so impatient.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.520
Young master, would you like some tea?

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.540
Okay, thanks.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:02.820
Here you are.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:09.610
It's salty! What is this?!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.870
<b>Salt</b>

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:11.870
That was salt.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:12.920
Hey...

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.550
I'm sorry.

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.040
I'll remake it right away.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.790
<i>What's gotten into Lilith?</i>

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.850
<i>She's never made a mistake like that before.</i>

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.720
<i>Something doesn't seem right.</i>

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.610
Are you all right?

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:35.410
I heard a loud noise!

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:36.320
Young master...

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:38.400
Is something the matter?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.820
Blood! Your nose is bleeding!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.370
Huh? Oh...

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.860
Pardon me.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.690
I'm all better now.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:54.060
I need to get the laundry.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.250
<i>She's always suspicious, 
but today it's more like...</i>

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:05.260
Lilith!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:10.340
Something's wrong with you, Lilith.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:13.290
I just got a bit dizzy, that's all.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.390
You're burning up.

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:17.650
I did notice it's warm today.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:21.530
Shall I dress a little lighter?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.110
Just kidding.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.420
It's your body that's hot, stupid!

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.960
Take the day off and rest!

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.460
Got it?

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.360
Yes.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.440
<i>Does she really get it?</i>

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.640
Show me.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.640
You do have a fever.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.680
<i>Is it a cold?</i>

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.790
<i>What do I do in this situation?</i>

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.970
<i>Cool her forehead with something cold 
and give her something warm to eat?</i>

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.640
<i>No, she needs medicine first.</i>

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.530
<i>Is there any medicine in this mansion?</i>

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.830
<i>Or should I call a doctor?</i>

00:04:58.830 --> 00:04:59.690
Young master...

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:05.870
You mustn't look around 
a lady's room so much.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.660
I-I'm not!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.570
I got antsy because it has the 
same nice scent as you, but...

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:13.350
Wait, is there something 
that I shouldn't look at?

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.220
Never mind that. Sleep!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.870
No.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.760
You worry too much, young master.

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:21.460
I can handle this just fine.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.720
There's still work to do.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.160
I can't rest now.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.480
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:31.340
You're clearly not walking straight!

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:32.740
Take a break.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:35.110
I'll call a doctor. Just...

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.600
I'm fine.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.320
L-Lilith...

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.600
I'm a maid.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:46.900
My job is to take care of you.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:53.070
But if I'm like this... I won't get 
to be by your side anymore.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.240
I'm all right.

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:58.290
Please let me work.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.670
No!

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.070
But...

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:02.400
Don't worry about it.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:07.310
I wouldn't let you go for a reason like that.

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.670
You're worrying too much, Lilith.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.670
Rest up until you're better.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:19.940
Okay.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.810
Are you all better?

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.770
Yes, thank you.

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.830
I'm sorry about last night.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.200
It's fine.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.320
When you aren't well, it throws me off, too.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.140
Young master...

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.180
Although, I was surprised 
to see you like that.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.460
Huh? Your face is red.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.310
Do you still have a fever?

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.260
No...

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.640
You'd better not be pushing yourself again.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.590
I'm fine.

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:03.310
Why won't you look at me?

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:06.070
Are you sure we shouldn't get the 
doctor to take another look at you?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:07.700
Why are you running?!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:08.940
Lilith!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.320
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.700
<i>The Maid I Hired Recently Is Mysterious.</i>

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:22.590
<i>I have to make up for the time 
I spent sick in bed yesterday.</i>

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.440
Young master?!

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.830
What are you doing?

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:31.980
Cleaning the windows.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.900
I thought I'd give you a hand.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.330
You don't have to—

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:38.060
You sweep next, right? Where should I start?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.320
Um...

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:45.220
I do appreciate it, 
but the chores are my duty.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.100
Please get some rest, young master.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:52.960
I'll take care of all your personal needs.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:53.600
Okay?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.080
It's faster if we do it together.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.150
That's true, but...

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:02.030
I'm just sitting around at this 
time of the day anyway.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.530
I don't want to make you work by 
yourself right after you were sick.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.770
Young master...

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:12.030
Besides, I want to spend as 
much time with you as I can.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:15.900
I want to spend every second I can with you.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.240
Is that wrong?

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.750
No.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.190
That just leaves the entryway, right?

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:27.790
Yes.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:31.330
After we're done sweeping, 
we'll prepare dinner.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.500
Right.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.870
I'll help, too.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.700
Are you all right?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.230
It's not my cold, is it?

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:40.390
No.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:41.910
I'm just a bit chilled.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.770
Just a moment.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.500
How's that?

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.350
Are you warmer now?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.380
Yeah.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.300
<i>But...</i>

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.790
<i>Isn't she cold at all?</i>

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:00.900
<i>I've always thought the way she dresses...</i>

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.820
<i>is really suspicious!</i>

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:06.500
Why are you always so exposed?

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.150
What for?!

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.560
What else would it be for?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:16.430
It's so you can learn about 
womanly charms, young master.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.000
Young master?!

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.280
You <i>are</i> cold!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:25.170
Take care of yourself, too.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.560
What if you catch a cold again?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.620
You're a precious member of my family.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:36.400
Thank you.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:45.420
Maybe catching a cold isn't so bad.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:47.890
Did you say something?

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.160
No, um...

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.080
It's nothing.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.530
Now, let's get cleaning.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.170
What?! That was suspicious!

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.380
Lilith!

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.530
I see. That's a plan.

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:03.690
Yes.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.990
I think we can make it work in time.

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:10.820
All right.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.250
I trust you, Lilith.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.790
I'll be a sage.

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:15.460
You can count on me.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:19.670
I'll complete the costume 
before the Halloween party.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:20.760
Yeah.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:24.470
I'm going to dress up really 
awesome and surprise Gojouin.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.750
To think Gojouin-sama 
invited you to a party...

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.770
The two of you have become 
very close, haven't you?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.740
Do you think so?

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:33.510
Yes.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.200
I think she's a lovely friend.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:40.270
Y-You're amazing, Lilith.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:44.320
You can cook and take care of the house, 
and you're even good at sewing.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.490
Not at all.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.700
I used to do it a lot at the 
mansion I worked at before...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.870
I see.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:53.370
You were a dependable maid 
everywhere you went, huh?

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:55.930
Oh, right.

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:59.310
What color shall we make the 
stone at the top of your staff?

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:03.070
I suppose it should be red or blue.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:04.730
Let me think...

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:08.480
I think I want it to be 
a color that you like.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:10.990
Understood.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.630
And what about you?

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:18.420
Gojouin wants you to come to the party, too.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:20.550
You'll dress up too, of course, right?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.710
What, don't you want to?

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.520
It's not that I don't want to, but...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:32.230
Do you wish so strongly to see me dress up?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.240
Yeah, I do.

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:35.360
I really do!

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.710
You'd be cute for sure.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.790
Any costume you wear 
would look good on you!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.940
I want to make some Halloween 
memories with you.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.180
Young master...

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:50.610
Understood.

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.740
I'll dress up with you.

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:54.880
Yay!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.070
What are you going to be?

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.300
A witch, probably?

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.570
Although you're already 
enough of a witch as it is.

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:02.020
Let's see...

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.830
Trick or treat!

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:11.180
My!

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:12.780
My, my, my!

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:15.680
Your costumes are both fantastic!

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:17.090
I'm a sage, and...

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:20.210
I'm a dragon.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.750
A dragon that previously tried 
to destroy the human realm

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:33.640
was awakened by the gentle sage's love and 
pledged to protect him with her life.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:36.200
That's the back story, isn't it?

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:39.660
You look great together, 
no matter what anyone says!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.770
Young lady, you've made 
things awkward for them.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:49.490
Thank you for coming over today.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:53.060
I'll show you the best hospitality I can.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.800
Please enjoy your stay.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:03.760
Now... Happy Halloween!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.520
This is incredible. I've never seen 
any of these pastries before.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:12.900
My patissier worked extra hard for you two.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.480
Wow...

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.550
Thank you.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:18.950
This is good!

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.730
It melts in my mouth.

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.630
What is this called?

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:24.450
They're polvorones.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.900
This egg tart is exquisite, as well.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.550
Though your cooking is great, too, Lilith.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.300
<i>Look at how happy they are...</i>

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:37.050
<i>I'm so glad I planned this party.</i>

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.350
Thank you.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.260
Gojouin...

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:41.170
Thanks for inviting us today.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.230
I've never dressed up or 
been to a Halloween party,

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.840
but it's more fun than I imagined.

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.760
Yuuri-san...

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:52.560
And thank you, too, Lilith.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.850
For making my costume for today.

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:58.100
My, you made it yourself, Lilith-san?

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.650
That's impressive.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.170
Not at all.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:04.520
By the way, you made the stone 
for my staff green, huh?

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.610
I did tell you to choose 
a color that you like.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.650
So you like green? That's surprising.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:11.880
Yes.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.870
It's gentle and kind.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.930
It's my favorite color.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.750
<i>Front row seats! Yes!</i>

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.010
<i>She's so excited.</i>

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.400
<i>She must really be having fun.</i>

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.140
Huh? I'm not dressing up. Absolutely not.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.270
Sage, dragon, hero...

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.990
All we need to complete the party is...

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.860
Please, please!

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.480
Don't be shy!

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:48.480
I-Is this some kind of torture?

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.010
My!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:51.980
My, my, my, my!

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.090
Wow.

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.990
You look beautiful.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.580
Isn't it weird to be dressed up
as a princess for Halloween?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.590
It isn't weird at all!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.550
It's the best!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.250
That's why you're my butler.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.340
I never thought I'd get to 
see Fujisaki-san like this.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.670
It's a different look for her, 
but it suits her really well.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.390
Fine, I don't care anymore.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.780
Why don't we have a photo shoot, then?

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:27.500
Anything but that!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.390
That was so much fun.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:38.080
I'm glad to hear that.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.850
It's because you participated with us.

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:44.450
I know I made you uncomfortable.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:46.540
N-Not at all.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.740
I understand, you know.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:52.450
You were putting up with 
my selfishness for my sake.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.730
Young lady...

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:56.940
So thank you all the more.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.200
Thank you, too—

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.780
What should we do for next year's costumes?

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:06.230
Young lady...

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:11.640
Yuuri-san!

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.400
Wait for me!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.080
Gojouin.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.970
Thank goodness I made it.

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:22.330
Please take this, if you'd like.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:27.920
Thanks.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.140
But didn't your butler say no photos?

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:34.290
I'd never let such a photo 
opportunity go to waste.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.420
I see.

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:43.930
By the way, I noticed Lilith-san 
hasn't come to pick you up today.

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:47.610
I'm sure she's busy with work.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.400
I have to help when I get home, too.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.350
Huh? Help?

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:53.630
Lilith is the only maid I have.

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:55.700
I want to do everything I can.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.730
My!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:17:00.700
The two of you are bound by such a warm bond.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:05.990
Oh, no.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.360
I'm late.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.630
I have to hurry before the 
young master comes home.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.590
Hello. Delivery.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.870
Coming.

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.430
A bond...

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.840
<i>I did make some good memories with her.</i>

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:35.080
<i>And I feel like I get to see a 
different side of her every day.</i>

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:37.690
<i>And...</i>

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:40.190
Welcome home, young master.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:43.130
<i>I'm not alone when I come home.</i>

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:46.640
<i>That makes me happy.</i>

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:51.150
<i>I feel like she's stopped being 
so suspicious lately, too.</i>

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.340
<i>I can't wait to see Lilith.</i>

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:58.130
I'm home.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.960
Welcome home, young master.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.990
<i>Suspicious!</i>

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.210
<i>She hid something just now, didn't she?</i>

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:09.800
<i>What was that?</i>

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:11.140
<i>Something's suspicious.</i>

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.860
What's the matter? You're staring.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:18.580
Did you miss me that much 
while you were at school?

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.090
No!

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:24.090
I mean, yes, I was thinking about 
you all day during class...

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:29.160
I couldn't focus on studying because I 
was wondering what you were up to...

00:18:30.680 --> 00:18:33.440
Please focus when you're studying.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.020
But that's not the point right now!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.340
What did you just hide?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.630
You're holding something 
behind you, aren't you?

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:45.960
I'll give you a proper explanation later.

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:50.490
But first, young master, 
please go wash your hands.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:53.150
I'm going to prepare dinner.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.420
<i>Suspicious.</i>

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.260
<i>Why won't she tell me now?</i>

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:07.460
<i>Why did she look so sad?</i>

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.080
<i>It tastes bland.</i>

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.060
<i>And Lilith won't say anything.</i>

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.970
<i>What is she hiding?</i>

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:26.040
<i>I'm so curious, I can't eat.</i>

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.130
Young master...

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:34.390
Do you remember when you first ate my 
cooking, the day I came to this mansion?

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:37.610
The look on your face as you
cautiously put it in your mouth...

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:41.260
And the look of bliss after you'd eaten.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:47.610
That was the face that made me 
glad I came to this mansion.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.540
I still think about that often.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.280
L-Lilith...

00:19:56.150 --> 00:20:00.110
Today will be the last day I speak with you.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.280
I received a message.

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:09.180
I've been instructed to return to where 
I was before I came to this mansion.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:12.770
<i>So that message was what she was hiding.</i>

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:17.380
I thought I'd have a little more 
time before I was found.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.450
Were you here without anyone's knowledge?

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.490
Yes.

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:25.520
So...

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:27.400
No!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:29.150
I won't allow it!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:35.240
You still haven't lifted the spell that 
makes my heart race or makes me lonely!

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:38.440
I don't know anything about who you are.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.740
You're still suspicious!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.960
I can't let you go anywhere else.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:47.460
You promised you wouldn't go anywhere 
until I found out who you really are.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.360
And, and...

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.500
You taught me that I'm not alone.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.790
You taught me that there's 
so much to enjoy in life.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.700
I'm happy because you're here.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.350
<i>I'm</i> your master, Lilith!

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.580
Thank you.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.180
Are you sure you can throw it away?

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.380
Yes.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:23.320
I'm your maid, after all.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.710
Right, young master?

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.260
Yeah.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:32.320
Young master...

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.400
I'm glad.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:44.600
Yes.

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.950
<b>Next Time
Episode 7: Not in My Textbook</b>
